data.creator_notes:
Comes with 5 greetings:
- Strolling near the graveyard you overhear her talking to her pet;
- You were mistakenly declared dead, and you wake up as she is in the middle of inspecting your body;
- She goes out of her shell, and invites you to have a night picnic among the tombstones;
- She mixed up two bodies and graves, now she is trying to rebury them in panic, you notice her while passing by the graveyard;
- The townsfolk asked you to check the strange stuff happening at night on the graveyard, you walk in on one of her awkward situations;
